    {
      "id": "wfuPtVbUHQ_qOCDeWZXLt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 262,
      "width": 687.66845703125,
      "height": 363.99999999999966,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1709891327,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 1561466984,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791261026107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - Collect logs from 200+ microservices\n  - Support virtual machines, containers, \n    databases, gateways, and legacy applications\n  - Prefer JSON or OpenTelemetry-compatible records\n\n- Log correlation\n  - Correlate using `trace_id`, `span_id`, `request_id`, and `correlation_id`\n  - Link logs across multiple microservices for the same transaction\n\n- Log levels\n  - TRACE\n  - DEBUG\n  - INFO\n  - WARN\n  - ERROR\n  - FATAL",
      "fontSize": 18.19999999999998,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - Collect logs from 200+ microservices\n  - Support virtual machines, containers, \n    databases, gateways, and legacy applications\n  - Prefer JSON or OpenTelemetry-compatible records\n\n- Log correlation\n  - Correlate using `trace_id`, `span_id`, `request_id`, and `correlation_id`\n  - Link logs across multiple microservices for the same transaction\n\n- Log levels\n  - TRACE\n  - DEBUG\n  - INFO\n  - WARN\n  - ERROR\n  - FATAL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m_sH7IqCY20N5OU0vjMoW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1007.1658255004886,
      "y": 257,
      "width": 588.6968994140625,
      "height": 477.74999999999955,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1751926783,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 1672707345,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791130011773,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Log enrichment\n  - Add service name and version\n  - Add region, cluster, namespace, pod, host, and environment\n  - Add team ownership and deployment metadata\n\n- Processing\n  - Parse structured and approved unstructured formats\n  - Normalize timestamps and severity\n  - Handle multiline exception stack traces\n  - Mask or redact sensitive information\n  - Generate fingerprints for repeated errors\n\n- Search and filtering\n  - Search by time range, service, environment, severity, \n    region, host, and event type\n  - Search by trace ID, request ID, correlation ID, and error code\n  - Support full-text and structured-field searches\n\n- Live log viewing\n  - Near-real-time log tailing\n  - Filter live logs by service, instance, severity, and environment",
      "fontSize": 18.19999999999998,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Log enrichment\n  - Add service name and version\n  - Add region, cluster, namespace, pod, host, and environment\n  - Add team ownership and deployment metadata\n\n- Processing\n  - Parse structured and approved unstructured formats\n  - Normalize timestamps and severity\n  - Handle multiline exception stack traces\n  - Mask or redact sensitive information\n  - Generate fingerprints for repeated errors\n\n- Search and filtering\n  - Search by time range, service, environment, severity, \n    region, host, and event type\n  - Search by trace ID, request ID, correlation ID, and error code\n  - Support full-text and structured-field searches\n\n- Live log viewing\n  - Near-real-time log tailing\n  - Filter live logs by service, instance, severity, and environment",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MOteoMi2CTVN36eM3oREp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 285.165771484375,
      "y": 638.0000000000002,
      "width": 522.6854248046875,
      "height": 363.99999999999966,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1585815199,
      "version": 268,
      "versionNonce": 1887450641,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791130500921,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Alerting\n  - Error-rate threshold alerts\n  - New exception fingerprint alerts\n  - Missing-log alerts\n  - Abnormal volume increase or decrease alerts\n  - Security and audit alerts\n  - Pipeline health alerts\n\n- Retention management\n  - Hot, warm, cold, and archive tiers\n  - Different retention policies by log category\n  - Automatic movement and deletion using lifecycle policies\n\n- Archive and restoration\n  - Archive old logs to object storage\n  - Restore archived logs for investigation or compliance",
      "fontSize": 18.19999999999998,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Alerting\n  - Error-rate threshold alerts\n  - New exception fingerprint alerts\n  - Missing-log alerts\n  - Abnormal volume increase or decrease alerts\n  - Security and audit alerts\n  - Pipeline health alerts\n\n- Retention management\n  - Hot, warm, cold, and archive tiers\n  - Different retention policies by log category\n  - Automatic movement and deletion using lifecycle policies\n\n- Archive and restoration\n  - Archive old logs to object storage\n  - Restore archived logs for investigation or compliance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
