    {
      "id": "T8rPAPWZG14h33cFD3fgI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 330,
      "y": 2036,
      "width": 1034.4991455078125,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 33909247,
      "version": 82,
      "versionNonce": 635579697,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791144278922,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A log is a record/event of something that happened in a system.\n\nLog Levels: TRACE, DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR, FATAL\n\nLog4j: Log4j is a Java logging framework used by applications to create and write logs. \nIt handles log levels, formatting, and output to destinations such as files or the console.\n\nOpenTelemetry Logs: OpenTelemetry provides a standardized way to represent application logs \nas structured LogRecords. \nA LogRecord contains information such as timestamp, severity, message, attributes, and trace/span IDs, \nallowing logs to be consistently collected and correlated with other telemetry.\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A log is a record/event of something that happened in a system.\n\nLog Levels: TRACE, DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR, FATAL\n\nLog4j: Log4j is a Java logging framework used by applications to create and write logs. \nIt handles log levels, formatting, and output to destinations such as files or the console.\n\nOpenTelemetry Logs: OpenTelemetry provides a standardized way to represent application logs \nas structured LogRecords. \nA LogRecord contains information such as timestamp, severity, message, attributes, and trace/span IDs, \nallowing logs to be consistently collected and correlated with other telemetry.\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
